WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 076. SIMILAR LAWS. DIFFERENT SYSTEMS. Labels can conceal structure.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
QUESTION. WHO? WHAT AUTHORITY? WHEN? Narrow the comparison first.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
SOURCE. LOCATOR. ISSUED. EFFECTIVE. AS-OF. Keep answers attached to evidence.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
DISAGREEMENT. CONFLICT STAYS VISIBLE. Never guess missing dates.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. A MAP IS NOT AUTHORITY. Fictional jurisdictions only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. TRACE THE DIFFERENCE. Keep source, date, conflict, unknown.
